 "_comment": [
  "SHA-256 of the screen 1-9 truth rows of every synthetic practice, from the seed of commit 62047fc (before the",
  "pensioner applicants), with three deliberate changes that the DOM audit (bper-emulator/audit_truth.cjs) proved:",
  "screen 2 gains the Creazione row, shown at that scroll in all 64 practices (the reference's real truth lists it",
  "too); screens 1 and 2 lose the DENOMINAZIONE row of the 11 practices whose name the list cuts with an ellipsis",
  "(sim-004, 010, 015, 027, 036, 041, 046, 049, 056, 058, 063); since the list sizes its columns to their content",
  "(spec section 19), screen 3 gains what is left of the identity columns at the end of the scroll",
  "(bper_simulator_truth.list_end_shows): the NDG row of the 8 of those with screen 3 (a cut name keeps Denom. at",
  "its label's width) and the DENOMINAZIONE row of the 31 with screen 3 whose whole name is narrower than about 104 px",
  "(demo, sim-002 ... sim-062; for pensioners only rows_except_note is updated). screens: the whole evaluator CSV; rows_except_note:",
  "its parsed rows without screen 9 'Note",
  "della richiesta' (json.dumps, ensure_ascii=False); note_except_applicant: that note without its 'Richiedente",
  "di N anni, <employment>. ' sentence.",
  "Fourth change, proven by the same audit: an invented practice's list row draws other Evidenze marks picked from",
  "its key (list.js, bper_simulator_truth.evidence_slots); two or more marks widen the Evidenze column past its",
  "label, so screen 3 loses the NDG or DENOMINAZIONE row and, with many marks, screen 1 the Creazione row, in 30 practices:",
  "demo, sim-002, sim-004, sim-006, sim-010, sim-011, sim-013, sim-015, sim-016, sim-020, sim-022, sim-023, sim-025, sim-026, sim-027, sim-029, sim-030, sim-036, sim-039, sim-041, sim-044, sim-046, sim-048, sim-051, sim-052, sim-054, sim-058, sim-060, sim-061, sim-062.",
  "Evidence: screen 3 truth is defined at the 1164 CSS px capture window. The archive has ONE real screen at that width",
  "(reference elenco-03, 847 px): it shows only evidenze and its tooltip, no NDG or name; at 1865 px or wider the real",
  "list keeps NDG/name (8/8), as the emulator does. For the other practices the rule is inferred from that geometry.",
  "Fifth change, 2026-11-24: the seed's branches got shorter invented names (bper_synthetic_db.BRANCHES; real lines have at most 19 characters, tests/test_bper_branch_names.py), so the Filiale relazione row of screens 4-9 changes in all 64 practices and nothing else: screens and rows_except_note were recomputed (pensioners keep their stale screens digest), note_except_applicant is unchanged.",
  "Sixth change, 2026-11-24: the seed's Rapporto numbers end in a real-looking block (one leading zero, varied digits; bper_synthetic_db._account_tail, tests/test_bper_account_numbers.py) instead of seven zeros and a digit, which the live OCR misread; so the Rapporto row of screens 5-8 changes in all 64 practices and nothing else: screens and rows_except_note were recomputed (pensioners keep their stale screens digest), note_except_applicant is unchanged."
